cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use encore, please cite it as below."
title: "encore — a release radar and recommender for your Plex music library"
abstract: >-
  A free, self-hosted, notification-first companion for Plex music libraries: it
  reads the artists you already have, matches them to MusicBrainz, alerts you when
  any of them release something new, and recommends adjacent artists via
  ListenBrainz — never downloading anything.
type: software
authors:
